.inc CoilcraftTemplates.lib

*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 0604HQ-1N1
* Inductance = 1.1nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-17.6GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 0604HQ-1N1 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.079pF Ind=1.15nH
X1 port1 port2 Model2A PARAMS:
+ R1=2
+ R2=0.02
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.00000381
+ K3= {Ind}
.ends 0604HQ-1N1

